{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/minimumSpanningTree(weight:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"A minimum spanning forest: one minimum spanning tree per connected component.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"minimumSpanningTree"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/SpanningForest","text":"SpanningForest","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SpanningTrees0A6ForestV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP","text":"AdditiveArithmetic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL","text":"Comparable"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Edges are ordered by weight, then by position in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"edges"},{"text":". Under that order the minimum","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spanning forest is unique, and this is it. Its edges are listed in nondecreasing weight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and, among equal weights, in position order, and the weight is added up in that order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Sparse graphs (fewer than 4 edges per vertex) run Kruskal’s algorithm; denser ones run","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Prim’s under the same order and sort the edges taken.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weight"},{"text":" gives each edge’s weight from its position, so parallel edges can differ. It is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"called once for each edge that is not a self-loop and is not kept. Negative, zero and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"infinite weights are ordinary weights. A NaN weight traps; filter such edges out first.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(m log m)."}]}]},{"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No weight is NaN; the sum of the chosen weights, in the order listed, does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not overflow and is not NaN.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SpanningTrees","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P13SpanningTreesE07minimumC4Tree6weightAD0C6ForestVyxqd__Gqd__5Edges_5IndexQZXE_ts18AdditiveArithmeticRd__SLRd__lF","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Kruskal.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SpanningTrees\/Kruskal.swift#L21"},"title":"minimumSpanningTree(weight:)","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumSpanningTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpanningForest","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SpanningTrees0A6ForestV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/spanningtrees\/graphprotocols\/graph\/minimumspanningtree(weight:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Edges-swift.associatedtype":{"fragments":[{"text":"associatedtype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Collection","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"Edges","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/edges-swift.associatedtype","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/